---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About — DeveX Tools" description="About DeveX Tools and its founder Long Feixiang — an independent developer who researches and reviews developer tools first-hand.">
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: 32px; max-width: 740px; margin: 40px auto;">
    <h1 class="page-title">About DeveX Tools</h1>

    <section style="margin: 32px 0;">
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: center; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--bg-subtle);">
        <img src="/avatar.png" alt="Long Feixiang (龙飞翔)" style="width: 88px; height: 88px; border-radius: 16px; flex-shrink: 0;" />
        <div>
          <div style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700;">Long Feixiang (龙飞翔)</div>
          <div style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 2px;">Independent developer &amp; founder of DeveX Tools</div>
          <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 6px;">
            <a href="https://github.com/longfeixiang7650-dotcom" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--accent);">github.com/longfeixiang7650-dotcom</a>
            <span style="color: var(--text-muted);"> &middot; Jinan, Shandong, China</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin: 32px 0;">
      <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">
        <strong>DeveX Tools</strong> is an independent developer-tool resource and comparison site.
        I research and organize IDEs, CI/CD platforms, version control systems, API tools,
        and every other piece of software that crosses a developer's desk.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">
        Most "developer tool reviews" online are either marketing fluff paid for by vendors, or shallow
        listicles with no substance. I take a different approach: every entry on this site is compiled
        from official documentation, vendor-published information, and publicly available data —
        organized into clear, verifiable feature lists and comparisons you can act on.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">
        Every page on this site is written and maintained by me, <strong>Long Feixiang</strong>, an
        independent developer based in Jinan, Shandong, China. I don't fabricate author bylines, and I
        don't publish scores or ratings I can't justify. When I present a feature, a price, or a license,
        it comes from the tool's own documentation or public records at the time of writing.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin: 32px 0;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px;">My Editorial Principles</h2>
      <ul style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li style="margin-bottom: 4px;"><strong>No sponsored placements.</strong> Zero. Tools earn their spot on my lists based on merit, not marketing budget.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 4px;"><strong>Verifiable information.</strong> Feature lists, pricing, and licensing details are sourced from official documentation and public data — not invented for the sake of a review.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 4px;"><strong>No fabricated scores.</strong> I don't assign star ratings I can't justify. Instead, I give you the facts — features, pricing, and tradeoffs — so you can decide for yourself.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 4px;"><strong>Living references.</strong> I update entries as tools evolve. Since launching in 2026, I regularly refresh listings as new versions and features ship.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section style="margin: 32px 0;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px;">Contact</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
        Questions, suggestions, or tool recommendations?
        Reach out at <a href="mailto:info@devex-tools.net">info@devex-tools.net</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
